# Force binary handling for asset types — without this, Git falls back to
# per-file content-sniffing on every touch, which can misfire (as it did
# on leias-color-pack.pdf) and risk CRLF-mangling a binary file.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.svg binary
*.ico binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mov binary
*.webm binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
